OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe showers
OL,6,Fbecoming more scattered during this
OL,7,Fevening with the cloud thinning and
OL,8,Fbreaking. Any showers confined to the
OL,9,Fwest overnight, mainly dry with clear
OL,10,Fspells developing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,13,Fwith the best of the sunshine during
OL,14,Fthe morning. Thickening cloud bringing
OL,15,Fpatchy rain during the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
